  projectId?: string,
}): Promise<unknown>"},{"path":"tools.figma.create_session","description":"Create a session to record the user's current work involving a Figma file. Call once before the first read or edit, including review-only work, as soon as the file key is known. Pass that key and a short description of the requested work. Reuse the returned UUID as sessionId on eligible file tools for this same task, including calls to other files. If creating a file, call `create_new_file` first, then use its returned key. Reuse the session for follow-ups that modify, check, or finish the work already requested. Start a new session when the user introduces separate work with its own completion criteria; another message, tool call, or file change alone does not count.","signature":"tools.figma.create_session({
  /**
