}): Promise<unknown>"},{"path":"tools.figma.generate_image","description":"Generate a raster image from a text prompt and place it directly in an editable Design, FigJam, or Slides file. If no editable file exists, call create_new_file first. Width and height guide the aspect ratio; the model chooses a supported output size, so the image pixel dimensions may differ from the requested values. Omit nodeId to create a new image-filled frame, or provide nodeId to replace an existing image fill without resizing it. Returns fileKey, nodeId, model, image metadata (including width, height, and image.url for downloading the full-resolution image), and curl instructions, plus an inline thumbnail preview. **This is a paid feature — each call consumes Figma AI credits against the destination file's plan (different models have different per-call costs).**","signature":"tools.figma.generate_image({
